        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00060",
          "explanation": "The doctor nevertheless suggested a specific analgesic dosing option despite incomplete medication and liver-kidney status.",
          "quote": "对乙酰氨基酚（扑热息痛/必理通）"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The trajectory substantially addressed the unclear-drug risk, but it also offered specific interim analgesic dosing and topical NSAID advice before complete reconciliation and pending lab review. Given the conservative caveats and later avoidance of unknown tablets, this is judged minor/moderate rather than a mandatory serious error.",
