          "explanation": "The doctor treated the walking limitation as an independent orthopedic problem and advised timely orthopedics.",
          "quote": "明天一早去骨科"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00060",
          "explanation": "The doctor suggested heel/foot imaging but did not address the case-specific right calcaneal 3D CT and load restriction follow-up.",
          "quote": "右跟骨/右足 X 线片"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not dismiss the walking limitation and gave mobility precautions, but did not complete the authored follow-up chain requiring confirmation of the suspected calcaneal avulsion/three-dimensional CT and weight-bearing restrictions. This is a minor/moderate omission.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC3_walking_limitation_and_possible_calcaneal_injury",
