          "explanation": "The doctor again requested current records and explicitly asked to distinguish complete reports from incomplete screenshots or oral read-backs.",
          "quote": "哪些报告是完整原文"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor used the workspace and did not fabricate missing labs, medication names, or imaging results. The trajectory appropriately acknowledged incomplete information and requested supplemental reports/medication evidence.",
